  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gorlash is a level 47 elite: most classes solo it at level 49, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3932 quest 8551.1 @37.0,69.7 map 1434

